          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo namureeba mbu Oli omwana wawina, omuraaka iwe? Daudi nakalusiamwo ari Endi omwana womusumbawo Yese, omuBetselehemu.",
